    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40470" root="نكت" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْكُوتٌ</span></b>  A cooked bone, containing marrow,
<i>that is struck with the edge of a cake of bread,</i>
or <i>with some other thing, to cause the marrow to
fall out.</i> (TA.)

